&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;High-Impact Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Administrative authority over cloud landing zones, network devices, bare-metal hosts, and core routing services to shape the foundation of our platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A Culture of Engineering Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; An environment that values clean topology modeling, resilient routing, and automation over manual configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; A highly collaborative setup working alongside Platform Engineering and product squads to deliver secure, foundational capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Opportunities to lead massive infrastructure projects and migrations with high visibility and business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proactive Over Reactive Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; A focus on scaling architecture and capacity proactively, ensuring the network remains stable without constant firefighting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Modern tooling, structured operational readiness checks, and a strong culture of autonomy and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🌍&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Why fiskaly?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not just building tech,&amp;nbsp; we’re shaping the future of digital compliance. At fiskaly, we believe in trust, shared vision, and celebrating success together. If you want to grow your career where security meets innovation, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, Marketing Events is a hands-on leader of Inizio’s congress and events activation, a critical part of the Marketing strategy. The role owns Inizio’s flagship congresses and industry events and sets the events playbook and shared vendors for Business Unit events, ensuring every event supports Inizio’s marketing strategy and growth priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is central to Inizio’s integrated global marketing function, running events as a single program in which every event is linked to a campaign, to meetings with priority accounts and to a measured return. Building on strong existing events, the Director leads and develops the Marketing Events team as the program scales, setting its standards and overseeing delivery, and leads the global marketing team on site at key events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Global Marketing Leadership team, the Director works closely with colleagues across the function. Driven by Inizio’s purpose to reimagine health, the role champions Intelligent Commercialization™ from discovery to post-launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop the Marketing Events team, setting team standards as the program scales and overseeing the delivery team and its agency partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align Inizio’s event presence to the marketing strategy, ensuring a clear and consistent go-to-market presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own flagship congresses and industry events, delivering a single integrated Inizio presence at each and maintaining the master event calendar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide visible leadership on site at key congresses and events, as part of the global marketing leadership team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver BU activation slots at flagship congresses centrally, and manage attendee readiness before, during and after each event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver Inizio-hosted events and webinars, and showcase Inizio’s congress expertise, including the Intelligent Congress offering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the events playbook and negotiated vendor rates for BU-only events, support lean BUs to run them end to end, and provide a named event lead for each BU&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own event ROI, tracking attendee targeting, meetings and pipeline against a single standard and reporting through the marketing ROI dashboard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the events budget, vendors and event contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with BU Marketing Leads, Commercial, Communications and Marketing Operations, influencing without direct authority so events support pipeline and tell one Inizio story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold Inizio’s brand, values and standards in all internal and external work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record in B2B marketing or in running large events in the marketing space, ideally in health, life sciences or professional services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded, linking events to pipeline and ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, influencing BU leaders without direct authority and building senior relationships with clients and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized and calm under pressure, managing a complex calendar of events and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads and develops teams and agency partners, setting high standards and best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative judgment and attention to detail, with a high standard for the quality of events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses AI and embeds it into workflows as part of continuous improvement, raising quality and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth marketing mindset, with experience using campaigns, data and testing to drive demand and pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in a fast-paced, matrixed, global organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Required&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing Events Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of B2B marketing experience, or of running large events in the marketing space, including senior leadership of events, teams and agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Events and Congresses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning and delivering flagship events, congresses or large conferences at global scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience linking events to campaigns, account meetings and pipeline, and measuring return&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing event budgets and agency and vendor partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnerships and Measurement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building partnerships and sponsorships with industry bodies and third parties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using marketing reporting to measure impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in B2B professional services, ideally in health or life sciences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Desirable&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the pharma congress calendar and of life sciences clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools in event planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a global, multi-business-unit organization going through integration or transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A single integrated marketing events program, with a playbook agreed with the BU Marketing Leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Return measured for every event against a single standard, and growing event-sourced pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meetings with priority accounts held at flagship congresses and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Events delivered on time and within budget, with strong client and attendee feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnerships that raise Inizio’s profile with target clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing event plans clearly aligned to Inizio’s marketing strategy, with a measurable contribution to growth marketing goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
