&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior TA Operations Specialist, you’ll own the dashboards and recurring reporting that recruiters and leaders use to make hiring decisions at GitLab. You’ll define how Talent Acquisition (TA) measures hiring, use artificial intelligence (AI) to automate reporting work, and turn findings into recommendations. You’ll also own the systems recruiters rely on and lead operations initiatives from defining the problem through rollout, adoption, and measurement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own TA dashboards, from defining recruiting metrics to building and maintaining reports. Check that the same metrics use consistent definitions and match across dashboards and recurring reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver recurring reports for recruiters, TA leaders, and executives on pipeline health, conversion between hiring stages, time to hire, sourcing effectiveness, and progress against the hiring plan. Recommend changes and track which recommendations lead to action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to automate data preparation, flag unusual changes, and draft written analysis so reports explain the numbers. Track the time it takes to prepare each recurring report to see whether automation saves time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead TA Operations initiatives from business case and stakeholder agreement through design, build, and rollout. Define success before launch, track adoption and results, and revise or retire solutions that don’t deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure GitLab’s recruiting tools, including hiring stages, fields, picklists, scorecards, user access, and permissions in the applicant tracking system (ATS). Own the integrations, lead incident response, and track failures and time to restore service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deploy AI agents and automated workflows for recruiting and reporting. Refine prompts, manage models, and track how often agents complete the tasks they’re designed to handle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build business cases for investing in AI and reporting tools using adoption data. Track usage after rollout to see whether the tools are being adopted as expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own TA’s AI governance framework. Track which AI workflows have completed bias audits, fairness reviews, and privacy compliance checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in recruiting operations, human resources technology, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and owning recruiting dashboards for senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to extract, validate, and visualize data, then explain what it means for hiring decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI to speed up reporting and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading initiatives from problem definition to launch and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience configuring and owning an enterprise ATS and its integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building and deploying AI agents or automated workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience. Many successful candidates don’t meet every requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Talent Acquisition Operations, we support the systems, reporting, and workflows GitLab uses to hire. You’ll work with our recruiters, TA leaders, and executives to make hiring data easier to act on and bring automation into recruiting workflows with clear standards for fairness and privacy. We work remotely and asynchronously.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this role’s listed level is currently for residents of the&amp;nbsp;United States only. This range is intended to reflect the role&#39;s base salary rate in locations throughout the US.&amp;nbsp;Grade level and salary ranges are determined through interviews and a review of education, experience, knowledge, skills, abilities of the applicant, equity with other team members, alignment with market data,&amp;nbsp;and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;The base salary range does not include any bonuses, equity, or benefits. See more information on our &lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLBeneUS&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/stock-options/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLequity&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/a&gt;. Sales roles are also eligible for incentive pay targeted at up to 100% of the offered base salary.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$104,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$176,400 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
